## CLI Configuration (YAML)

### Data File Upload

```yaml
Config:
  api-url: https://api.example.com/graphql
  token: "your-api-token"
  submission: submission-uuid
  type: data file
  data: /path/to/data/files/
  manifest: /path/to/manifest.tsv
  archive_manifest: /path/to/archive-manifest.tsv  # optional, for ZIP files
  id-field: file_id                                 # optional
  retries: 3
  overwrite: false
  dryrun: false
```

### Metadata Upload

```yaml
Config:
  api-url: https://api.example.com/graphql
  token: "your-api-token"
  submission: submission-uuid
  type: metadata
  data: /path/to/metadata/folder/
  retries: 3
  overwrite: false
  dryrun: false
```

