## CLI Output Patterns (for verification)

Success indicators in CLI stdout:
- `"File uploading completed!"` — upload finished
- `"Files failed: 0"` — no failures
- `"Files processed: N"` — N files were processed
- `"Files copied: N"` — N files were copied to S3
- `"X out of Y file(s) have been validated"` — validation complete (X should equal Y)

Failure indicators:
- `"Failed to upload files"` — upload failure
- `"can't get data file config"` — API/permission error
- Non-zero exit code

### Upload Report (`tmp/upload-report-*.tsv`)

Generated in `<cliDir>/tmp/` after each run. TSV columns include:
- `file_name` / `internal_file_name` — file identifier
- `succeeded` — `true` or `false` per file
- `errors` — error messages (Python list format: `['msg1', 'msg2']`)

