## Katalon Integration (CliUploader.groovy)

### Location

`Keywords/utilities/CliUploader.groovy` — integrates CLI uploader into Katalon test automation.

### CLI Location Resolution

Default: `Tools/crdc-datahub-cli-uploader-src` (Python source). Override with profile variable `CRDC_CLI_DIR`. Prefers binary (`uploader`/`uploader.exe`) if present; otherwise runs `python3 src/uploader.py`.

### Key Public Keywords

| Keyword | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `CliUploader.uploadFilesViaCli(testCaseName, dataType)` | Upload data files or metadata via CLI |
| `CliUploader.verifyCliErrorMessages(testCaseName)` | Compare CLI error report against expected errors |

### `uploadFilesViaCli(testCaseName, dataType)`

- **dataType**: `"datafile"` / `"data file"` / `"metadata"` (case-insensitive)
- Reads API URL from `GlobalVariable.ApiUrl`, token from `GlobalVariable.SubmitterApiToken`
- Reads submission ID from current browser URL via `DataSubmissions.getSubmissionIdFromUploadActivityUrl()`
- Resolves data path: `InputFiles/CRDC/MetadataData/{testCaseName}/DataFiles` (data) or `.../Metadata` (metadata)
- Resolves manifest: first `*manifest.tsv` file in the DataFiles folder
- Builds YAML config, writes temp file, runs CLI process, verifies output
- Refreshes browser after successful upload

### `verifyCliErrorMessages(testCaseName)`

- Reads latest `upload-report-*.tsv` from CLI `tmp/` folder
- Reads expected errors from `InputFiles/CRDC/MetadataData/{testCaseName}/expected/*.tsv`
- Expected TSV columns: `file_name` + `expected_errors` (or `expected_error`)
- Normalizes error values (Python list format → sorted, joined with ` | `)
- Generates comparison report in `Reports/CLI_ErrorVerification/`

### Profile/GlobalVariable Dependencies

| Variable | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `ApiUrl` | GraphQL API endpoint |
| `SubmitterApiToken` | API auth token |
| `CRDC_CLI_DIR` | Override CLI root directory (optional) |
| `CRDC_CLI_RETRIES` | Retry count, default 3 (optional) |
| `CRDC_CLI_OVERWRITE` | Overwrite existing files, default false (optional) |
| `CRDC_CLI_DRYRUN` | Dry-run mode, default false (optional) |
| `CRDC_MANIFEST_ID_FIELD` | Custom manifest ID field name (optional) |
| `CRDC_ARCHIVE_MANIFEST_PATH` | Archive manifest path for ZIP files (optional) |

