## Test Data Folder Convention

```
InputFiles/CRDC/MetadataData/{testCaseName}/
├── DataFiles/              # Data files + *manifest.tsv (for "data file" type)
├── Metadata/               # TSV/TXT metadata files (for "metadata" type)
└── expected/               # Expected error TSVs (for verifyCliErrorMessages)
    └── *.tsv               # Columns: file_name, expected_errors
```

