## Script Pattern for CLI Upload Tests

```groovy
// 1. Login and navigate to Data Submissions
CustomKeywords.'utilities.Login.navigateToCrdc'()
CustomKeywords.'utilities.Login.loginToCrdcOtp'('Submitter')
CustomKeywords.'utilities.WebUIUtils.clickTab'('CRDC/NavBar/DataSubmissions-Tab')

// 2. Create a submission (or navigate to existing one)
CustomKeywords.'utilities.Pbac.createDataSubmission'()
CustomKeywords.'utilities.WebUIUtils.clickTab'('CRDC/AILocators/DataSubmissions/List/Table/SubmissionName-Link')

// 3. Upload via CLI (browser must be on upload-activity tab for submission ID)
CustomKeywords.'utilities.CliUploader.uploadFilesViaCli'('TC_Name', 'datafile')
// or for metadata:
CustomKeywords.'utilities.CliUploader.uploadFilesViaCli'('TC_Name', 'metadata')

// 4. Verify error messages (for negative test cases)
CustomKeywords.'utilities.CliUploader.verifyCliErrorMessages'('TC_Name')

// 5. Continue with UI verification after CLI upload
CustomKeywords.'utilities.WebUIUtils.clickTab'('CRDC/AILocators/DataSubmissions/Detail/Tabs/ValidationResults-Tab')
// ... verify validation results, data view, etc.
```

