## CLI Features Relevant to Test Automation

- **MD5 caching**: Repeated runs on same files skip re-computation
- **Retry logic**: Configurable retries per file (default 3)
- **Dry-run mode**: Validates without uploading (set `CRDC_CLI_DRYRUN=true`)
- **Overwrite mode**: Re-uploads existing files (set `CRDC_CLI_OVERWRITE=true`)
- **Large file support**: Multipart upload for files >100MB, manual multipart for >5GB
- **S3-to-S3 transfer**: Source files can be S3 URLs
- **Archive support**: ZIP files with embedded manifest
- **Heartbeat**: Background thread prevents batch timeout during long uploads (300s interval)
- **File name validation**: Rejects empty names, duplicates, absolute paths, reserved characters
